        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giighaydiita gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahit Sulemani musiischooda, ghwararang'aana beasta humng'eeda ak ghameash haleanjeeda wagiida sigwariida ea lukghumajeega, ak gwaduk giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA gheeda sibata ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara ashoohoodiga ea mudu ghoamu gaweay jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA niduuk gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah fuga Israeli gidararang'aadayda beasta ak gwaduk giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, hean gwatkuy ea gagul gheamamuunatka nyaawa ng'eanyi, ak ghaghadoawan nea gabadiischeesa NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gwayeeniisa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadayda sugoocheanda sea buuneeda sean bea Israeli lukghumajeega aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghoadayda lukghumajeega heew sagalamnyooji diktam ea iyeenya ea gisil sagalamnyooji bughala ea diktam. Hean ng'ata sugoocheanda ea fuga sean bea Israeli ghoaghaydiit gheeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamiinaada ashoohoodiga aba heeda gadiydooscheewa; ak eara fuga Lawi, sea haleanjeeda sisarmaniida bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ghayi sin Dawdi bea badiischeesiinda NG'UTAMIIDA aba gideaba bariinyeagaaschi bea huumwa gwanda damanda manda muudeanooda, damanda duumsheesiina Dawdi aba gadiyeeda nyaawa, ak gwasarmanda ashoohoodiga durumbeati aba murdeeda nyaawa; ak ghamiinaada fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoaghaydiit Sulemani geeda mida bugusta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ak aba hoowa ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida ea gea riisheadi bea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea hoyyoo, aba gideaba heeda wagiida sisna gharinyeanda ghayi sin Sulemani moamu ghwasar haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida ea gea booga ea gea ghashneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean aba damandida gwasin Sulemani ghweelmeeda bea eawooji ispwa, sea fuga Israeli sea niny, ghoah guuyeeda haw, gidang'eada gidaghuuta Hamati ea gagul eenda Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba eaweeteaba sis geamughuush eemeeda saang'a bea aba gideaba niing'waay giighaydiita heeda wagiida aba eawooji ispwa, ea ghweelmeeda eawooji ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasiksa buuneeda gaweay jeesinga maheemajeega nyaawa eaweeteaba diktam ea samwagu, bea sheedeaba ispwa, nea gaba hooseaneega nea gang'weela gurooruunatka nyaawa aba doobiiwnata sean niihiimsa NG'UTAMIIDA Dawdi, ea Sulemani, ea fugaaschi was Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA goohiimsa geaw Sulemani gicha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahit Sulemani deekta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gheeda sugoocheanda; ea gida ghayi miisa gwasin aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gheanyi niny, hean ghwahit aba doobiiwnata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goohiimsa geaw NG'UTAMIIDA Sulemani eawa ak gwayeesha, “Naayiinyi musiischoadaang'u, ak ea naaloachi hiji ghoah deanyu, ghoah gheeda jea eesiniisa lukghumajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyaarachi humng'eeda ea maroabwana, ghana deajeagu deashamga ghwaak ng'eanyiida, ghana dajaksa fugeasu dawuni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inyas fugeasu siguuriisa aba gheawungeasu gayghwaat geat ng'eanyi, ak gwaduukuunana naweadinga nyaawa munyas, abeeda gaydealeeydiit, aba humng'eeda, ak abeeda gaydasamsa riing'eega nyaawa nea gaydaahaap ng'eanyiida nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamneawa gheanyangeasu gaydanung' ghwajaada nea iidigeasu gaydanung' gwayiing'shi aba musiischooda nyaawa aba hiji bea gheawiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamneawa naaloachi ak ea naaghaydiichi gheawi ak abeeda gaygwanda hoowa gheawungeasu damanda manda muudeanooda; gheanyangeasu ea gurooroodeanyu gaygwanda hoowa damanyoojiga sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara ang'iing'i inyas gaybeawana madeedeanyu, gawuurji gidaweeda Dawdeeda was ghweandaang'u, nea gisindi gida ghayi earukuneey nea giing'waanyi deaweedajeegeasu ea girgweaguutkeasu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda gaydamiinda hoorgeadaang'u bea gheambalmeeda, gawuurji gida ghayi siheeleesi sea Dawdeeda was ghweandaang'u, nea geayeeshi, ‘Mayghwaroat siichea goombal Israeli’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba inyas gajayamwa geat ak ghoanung'waadi deaweedajeegeasu ea diigheanyeekeasu ghayi aayiinyi madeedeang'wa, ak gooweayi aghadoawana nea ghoaghadoawanyi aseecheeka suuk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaydaang'aamwaneegwa jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi eagoonyeegwa, ak gheawi, ghayi neang'ushiin aba gheawungeasu, gaydaang'aamwa madeedeanyu, ak gaydanung' ghoah ghwasiildeanga ea giing'weaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gheawi, mida heetiyeadean, siisi nyooh ghang'at gayghahamng'eanyi, nea gay gwayi, ‘Anda ghwasaan NG'UTAMIIDA gwasima ng'asheanji ng'eanyiida ea gheawi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ak gaygwayi, ‘Aba gideaba ghwanung'wa heeda saawa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa ghayi aruuna saawa ng'eanyiida Misri, ak ghoang'waay geat sea aseecheeka suuk, ak ghabwat nea gagadiiyeesa; hean abeeda gweadu munyasnacheeksu badahuuka nyaawa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
